	(text "BIG MODULAR 4MIX - S2 schematic: 4-channel mixer with 2 sends / 2 returns, +/-12 V, 18HP (Bread Modular 4mix, no overdrive). Circuit intent: docs/research.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "12f428c1-0630-5316-90d1-22c81875c295")
	)
	(text "AUDIO MIXER: every input (channel, return, EXP IN) is AC-coupled; outputs are DC from the op-amps."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "27145789-3938-5b86-ad54-97a90784d9bd")
	)
	(text "CHANNELS: sheet channel.kicad_sch x 4. Each channel ties onto MAIN_SUM / SENDA_SUM / SENDB_SUM\n(virtual-ground summing nodes of U1B / U5A / U5B) through its own 100k resistors."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8b91aff8-69e9-532c-ab67-6fce6e99e8b6")
	)
	(text "OUTPUT: OUT = MAIN wiper + RETURN A + RETURN B (U3A sum, U3B invert), 1k series.\nUnity end to end at full CW; TL072 on +/-11.6 V clips near +/-10 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 91.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ab5d3d61-f50d-57ea-bf75-971c35e0c8ad")
	)
	(text "POWER: Eurorack +12V / -12V -> B5819W per rail -> +12V / -12V (about +/-11.6 V). J8 +5V unused.\nC3..C12 (root) and Cn02/Cn03 (channels): 100n at every op-amp supply pin; C1/C2: 10u bulk."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "bca31ec7-52fd-588c-9818-b352d524054e")
	)
	(text "EXPANSION (no jacks, back of the board): J7 EXP OUT carries this module's pre-master MAIN mix and SEND A/B mixes\n(1k each); J6 EXP IN takes another module's J7 and sums it into the buses with the input polarity (1M pull-downs:\nopen header = silent; 10u AC coupling). Chain: expander J7 -> master J6 (6-way 2x3 ribbon, every signal beside a GND)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 109.22 243.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e93e30e1-b7c4-55df-b01b-7ab834b9af62")
	)
	(text "RETURNS: jack -> 1u -> 10k -> unity follower (1M || 100p to GND) -> 100R -> level pot -> 100k -> OUT_SUM.\nReturns are summed after the MAIN pot (Bread Modular 4mix), so MAIN does not change them."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 215.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "eff4fada-9414-51b9-b1ee-078594c54f86")
	)
